    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4e69b33673c75af8af7a",
      "document_start": 59,
      "document_end": 78,
      "text": "# 2.3.1 有限元方法的基本原理;",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_23f7a72924461ca0f902",
      "document_start": 79,
      "document_end": 111,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_11a87f550ec55d828f25",
      "document_start": 113,
      "document_end": 216,
      "text": "在研究结构动力学问题时，经常会遇到机械在工作状态下，自身惯性与周围介质或结构的动力载荷相互作用，介质边界或内部的载荷引起位移、速度和应力变化等，如何保证它们运行的平稳性和结构的安全性，是极为重要的研究课题。",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_24e4e3908840c61b4ae8",
      "document_start": 216,
      "document_end": 243,
      "text": "正确分析和设计这类结构，在理论和实践中都具有重要意义。",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d772743ad4c34d3913ea",
      "document_start": 245,
      "document_end": 265,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d0a6e12e7037f2b35d9a",
      "document_start": 266,
      "document_end": 285,
      "text": "# 2.3.1 有限元方法的基本原理;",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_251b29b9fa9dedf17581",
      "document_start": 286,
      "document_end": 318,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2793586597883ec70b5b",
      "document_start": 320,
      "document_end": 387,
      "text": "对于结构动力学问题处理的方法，可以把系统简化成几个单个或多个质点系来建立系统运动方程，也可以利用变分法把这个系统当成连续介质体来处理。",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_17dde19c5f7ab07a9414",
      "document_start": 389,
      "document_end": 409,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5a8b86201f39687cfa46",
      "document_start": 410,
      "document_end": 421,
      "text": "# 2）构造插值函数;",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_bacaeae5ef1ddf2de9ad",
      "document_start": 422,
      "document_end": 454,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_90c4a4b0e49161b2a865",
      "document_start": 456,
      "document_end": 550,
      "text": "从广义坐标有限元方法出发，首先将场函数表示为多项式的函数形式，然后利用节点关系，将多项式中的待定参数表示成场函数的节点值和单元几何函数，从而将场函数表示成由其他节点值插值形式组成的表达式。",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4057e8a027ac44dba809",
      "document_start": 552,
      "document_end": 572,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2bc0509c12ee40201beb",
      "document_start": 573,
      "document_end": 587,
      "text": "# 3）形成系统的求解方程;",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_bc798a9cc410f5e58777",
      "document_start": 588,
      "document_end": 620,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2abcb54bdf09cf401602",
      "document_start": 622,
      "document_end": 682,
      "text": "根据弹性力学基本方程的变分原理建立单元结点力和结点位移之间的关系，得到系统的求解方程（在动力学问题中，又称为运动方程）：",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_417937774de628e43147",
      "document_start": 684,
      "document_end": 704,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 5;",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9b145f9d561955421f47",
      "document_start": 705,
      "document_end": 716,
      "text": "# （2）振型叠加法。",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a31a717b3182b379f8c3",
      "document_start": 716,
      "document_end": 717,
      "text": ";",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1c1b0476787625fff4a9",
      "document_start": 718,
      "document_end": 750,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8f43d5d9c862bc286af6",
      "document_start": 752,
      "document_end": 822,
      "text": "系统的固有频率和固有振型是动力系统的基本特征量，取决于系统整体的质量分布、刚度分布和阻尼分布，而与外部载荷情况无关，因此称之为“固有特性”。",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_31b43fada049a92609e5",
      "document_start": 822,
      "document_end": 871,
      "text": "系统的动力响应是系统在外载荷激励下所做出的动态响应，它不仅取决于外部载荷，还取决于系统的固有特性。",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_f54b0e97e7d212bb2789",
      "document_start": 873,
      "document_end": 893,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 6;",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_01a14eeaa9713b3641e3",
      "document_start": 894,
      "document_end": 912,
      "text": "# 5）计算系统的应力、应变与响应;",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8656dd4d5eeb543a7346",
      "document_start": 913,
      "document_end": 945,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4cc0ec938dc50de2bac1",
      "document_start": 947,
      "document_end": 1006,
      "text": "根据结点力平衡条件建立有限元方程，在给定边界条件下求解线性方程组，计算单元应力、应变，再通过协调原理推至这个连续体上。",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2834a3240f7f43120d96",
      "document_start": 1006,
      "document_end": 1033,
      "text": "系统在静力平衡条件下求得的应力、应变是静应力、静应变。",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_99803106e015eaa32cd5",
      "document_start": 1033,
      "document_end": 1057,
      "text": "系统在外激励下内部产生的应力、应变是动应力、动应",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1881d953165eace117aa",
      "document_start": 1059,
      "document_end": 1079,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 7;",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1916c996f7197e120274",
      "document_start": 1080,
      "document_end": 1090,
      "text": "# 1）材料非线性;",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_cb2e6b5be4e056af08b2",
      "document_start": 1091,
      "document_end": 1123,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1f78d02e55faeec0ca07",
      "document_start": 1125,
      "document_end": 1198,
      "text": "非线性弹性与弹塑性材料中的塑性阶段均呈现非线性物理性质，按加载过程考察，这两类问题的非线性性质相同，只要给出其非线性本构关系，其计算方法是一样的。",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_f1155c5be8c8a067931a",
      "document_start": 1198,
      "document_end": 1231,
      "text": "其不同点表现在：一是弹塑性材料的转折点出现在从弹性进入塑性的阶段；",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ef0982191e1d9c75235d",
      "document_start": 1231,
      "document_end": 1248,
      "text": "二是卸载过程会出现不同的物理现象。",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_134269461cdb9bc057ad",
      "document_start": 1248,
      "document_end": 1278,
      "text": "非线性弹性问题是可逆的，卸载后结构应变会恢复到加载前的水平。",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_c21aa0d87d562623434e",
      "document_start": 1278,
      "document_end": 1333,
      "text": "而弹塑性材料却会出现不可逆应变，即弹性阶段是可逆的，塑性阶段是不可逆的，且其卸载时的载荷-应变曲线呈线性关系。",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1f8333b6b2e6f60a5bfe",
      "document_start": 1333,
      "document_end": 1359,
      "text": "再加载时会出现残余应变和大于初始弹性极限的弹性区域。",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_eb0b98f4078c886b073f",
      "document_start": 1359,
      "document_end": 1385,
      "text": "因此，导致应力-应变关系的不唯一，且与加载历史有关。",
      "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee"
    }
  ],
