          "document_end": 1278,
          "text": "非线性弹性问题是可逆的，卸载后结构应变会恢复到加载前的水平。",
          "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee",
          "start": 1248,
          "end": 1278,
          "chunk_start": 1248,
          "chunk_end": 1278,
          "sentence_document_start": 1248,
          "sentence_document_end": 1278,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_c21aa0d87d562623434e",
          "document_start": 1278,
          "document_end": 1333,
          "text": "而弹塑性材料却会出现不可逆应变，即弹性阶段是可逆的，塑性阶段是不可逆的，且其卸载时的载荷-应变曲线呈线性关系。",
          "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee",
          "start": 1278,
          "end": 1333,
          "chunk_start": 1278,
          "chunk_end": 1333,
          "sentence_document_start": 1278,
          "sentence_document_end": 1333,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_1f8333b6b2e6f60a5bfe",
          "document_start": 1333,
          "document_end": 1359,
          "text": "再加载时会出现残余应变和大于初始弹性极限的弹性区域。",
          "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee",
          "start": 1333,
          "end": 1359,
          "chunk_start": 1333,
          "chunk_end": 1359,
          "sentence_document_start": 1333,
          "sentence_document_end": 1359,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_eb0b98f4078c886b073f",
          "document_start": 1359,
          "document_end": 1385,
          "text": "因此，导致应力-应变关系的不唯一，且与加载历史有关。",
          "section_id": "section_a480a6fe9dee",
          "start": 1359,
          "end": 1385,
          "chunk_start": 1359,
          "chunk_end": 1385,
          "sentence_document_start": 1359,
          "sentence_document_end": 1385,
          "sentence_complete": true
        }
      ],
